-- DPDP Compliance Manager: synthetic demonstration data
-- File 3 of 3 (optional). Run after database_schema.sql and row_level_security.sql.
-- GENERATED by tools/build_seed.py. Edit the generator, not this file.
--
-- EVERYTHING HERE IS FICTIONAL. No real person, school, client or legal opinion is
-- represented. Tenants are flagged is_demo = true and the screens must show a Demo banner.
--
-- What you get
--   Two fictional CA firms, three client institutions (a school, a college and a vocational
--   institute) and 18 demo users covering every role. Firm 1 serves the school and the
--   college. Firm 2 serves the institute. This lets you test that one firm and one client
--   can never see another.
--
-- Legal content
--   Every legal source and control below is a DEMO RECORD. Commencement status is "Requires
--   Verification" and none of it has been verified against the Gazette. They are approved
--   only because is_demo = true bypasses the verification gate. Replace them with controls
--   your reviewer has approved before any real engagement.
--
-- Signing in as a demo user
--   The demo users have no password and example.test email addresses, so nobody can sign in
--   as them by accident. To try a persona, change that user's email to an address you
--   control (update auth.users set email = '...' where id = '...';), then send a password
--   recovery email from Authentication > Users in the Supabase dashboard. Choose your own
--   password. There is no shared default password.
--
-- Evidence files
--   Evidence rows describe files that do not exist. Their titles say so. Upload tests need
--   real files in the private "evidence" bucket.
--
-- Safety
--   This script refuses to run if the database already holds a non-demo client, or if the
--   demo data is already loaded.
-- =====================================================================

do $$
begin
  if exists (select 1 from public.tenants where not is_demo) then
    raise exception 'Refusing to load demo data: this database already holds real client tenants';
  end if;
  if exists (select 1 from public.tenants where is_demo) then
    raise exception 'Demo data is already loaded';
  end if;
end $$;

